<Td>No.43
<Td colspan="2"><B><Font size="4"><A Href="http://yahoo.jp/box/2AanLP" Target="_top">二本の剣、蒼き勇者</Font></B></A>
<Td>容量：3.10MB
<Tr>
<Td colspan="5">
<Img Src="ss/43a.png "onmouseover="this.src='ss/43b.png'" onmouseout="this.src='ss/43a.png'" Border="0"><Tr>
